Meross Local Cloud (meross_cloud) — unofficial fork
===================================================

This repository is a fork of:
  https://github.com/albertogeniola/meross-homeassistant

Original project: meross-homeassistant
Original license: MIT
Original copyright: Copyright (c) 2023 Alberto Geniola

The fork changes distribution metadata and documentation so the integration
can be installed as a HACS custom repository and used with the Meross Local
Broker add-on. It adds roller-shutter open/close duration number entities
(`signalOpen`/`signalClose`), calibration start/stop buttons and a calibration
status sensor (`Appliance.RollerShutter.Adjust`); it does not change the Meross
cloud API protocol.
